OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after disorder at
OL,4,Ayouth football match
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter disorder involving about 30
OL,8,Fpeople at an under-18s football match
OL,9,Fin Leicestershire.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere deployed to Owen Street in
OL,13,FCoalville at 16:00 BST on Sunday,
OL,14,Ffollowing altercations at the game
OL,15,Fbetween Coalville Town and Syston Town.
OL,17,FNo-one suffered serious injuries and
OL,18,Fpolice inquiries are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
